 DEFINE GROUP(LIFECORE) DESCRIPTION(LifeCore IQ CICS Resources)
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* LIFECORE IQ - CICS CSD DEFINITIONS                                 *
* Aplica via: DFHCSDUP SCRIPT(HERC01.LIFECORE.CSD)                   *
*             ou CEDA INSTALL GROUP(LIFECORE)                         *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
*
* --- PROGRAMAS CICS -------------------------------------------------
*
 DEFINE PROGRAM(LCCICS01)
        GROUP(LIFECORE)
        DESCRIPTION(LifeCore IQ - Login)
        LANGUAGE(COBOL)
